# Copy to `.env` and fill in your key. `.env` is gitignored -- never commit it.
#
# Get a key at https://home.openweathermap.org/api_keys
#
# The FREE tier is sufficient. This app uses only:
#   - Geocoding API      /geo/1.0/direct
#   - 5 day / 3 hour     /data/2.5/forecast
#
# It deliberately does NOT use One Call 3.0 (`timemachine`, `day_summary`),
# which needs a separate paid "One Call by Call" subscription -- see the README
# section "Why forecast and not history".
#
# New keys can take ~10 minutes to activate; until then every call returns 401.
OPENWEATHER_API_KEY=
